# Local AI agent skills and design tooling (not part of the project)
.agents/
design-system/

# Serving bundle (committed on purpose)
# The Backend cannot score a group without a checkpoint, the train-only
# ratings, the ID mapping and the movie catalog, and a deployment must not
# run the data pipeline. The bundle is under 1 MB and is rebuilt with
# python scripts/build_serving_bundle.py. These rules come last so they
# override the broad artifacts/, *.pt and *.csv rules above.
!artifacts/serving/
!artifacts/serving/mf_checkpoint.pt
!artifacts/serving/train_ratings.csv.gz
!artifacts/serving/movies.csv.gz
!artifacts/serving/id_mappings.json
